      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just want to verify. Will UV Tile Discard still be a thing as said in this forum post by a team member? And will the Standard Lite and Toon Standard shader optionally support it? I would love to have more control over my fallback shader, and I rely on UV Tile Discard way too much. Typically the only downside to using it over hiding with blendshapes is that the effect doesn't work with fallback shaders. https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-13-february-2025/41299/25",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
